### Paths too long for Windows, and what to do about them.

## What follows an error that says a path is too long.

long-paths-advice-windows = A path here is longer than Windows takes (260 characters) unless long paths are turned on. Turn on git's long paths for this repository ("Turn on long paths", or `git config core.longpaths true`; with `--global` for every repository and every clone), or move the repository to a shorter folder.
long-paths-advice = A name in this path is longer than the file system takes (often 255 bytes), or the whole path is longer than the system takes.
